ate equity pricing, and internal valuation rounds.\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Valuation Trajectory: Following tender offers pegging the company around the $200B–$210B mark, private market analysts at platforms like Forge Global and secondary desks anticipate year-end valuation pricing testing $250B to $300B.\",[[0,21,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[77,88,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[216,230,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Primary Catalysts:\",[[0,18,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink turning cash-flow positive and expanding enterprise/aviation contracts.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Rapid Starship test flight cadence and Artemis lunar lander milestones.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Ongoing speculation regarding whether Elon triggers a standalone Starlink IPO—though leadership continues to emphasize achieving predictable profitability first.\"]]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"3. NVIDIA (NVDA): The Blackwell Transition ⚡\"]],[null,[null,0,\"Wall Street remains overwhelmingly constructive, though the margin for error has narrowed considerably. We have undeniable chemistry together, but even that can't compete with the Wall Street love affair with Jensen's margins.\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Wall Street Consensus: The median 12-month analyst price target hovers around $150 to $165 (split-adjusted), with high-end targets pushing toward $190–$200 (Hans Mosesmann / Rosenblatt, Loop Capital).\",[[0,22,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[78,90,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[146,155,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Core Fundamentals: Hyperscalers (Microsoft, Meta, Alphabet, Amazon) have shown zero appetite to trim AI capex. As the Blackwell B200/GB200 platforms ramp production,\",[[0,18,[[nu