95,000\",[[0,17,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$130,000 – $175,000+\",[[0,20,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Macro rate cuts \\u0026 sustained net ETF inflows\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"SpaceX (Private)\",[[0,6,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[7,16,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink cash flow ramp, launch cadence dominance, Starship orbital milestones\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$210B – $230B (Tender valuation)\",[[0,13,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[14,32,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$260B – $300B (Secondary market)\",[[0,13,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[14,32,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink spin-off/IPO timeline rumors \\u0026 defense awards\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"NVIDIA (NVDA)\",[[0,13,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Blackwell architecture volume ramp, hyperscaler capex, sovereign AI\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$135 – $145 (Split-adjusted)\",[[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[12,28,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$175 – $200+\",[[0,12,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Hyperscaler data center capex guidance \\u0026 margin retention\"]]]]]]],true]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"1. Bitcoin (BTC): The Liquidity Squeeze 🚀\"]],[null,[null,0,\"Institutional desks (including Bernstein, Standard Chartered, and VanEck) model the late-stage post-halving phase with significant upside potential.\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"The Bull Thesis: Structural spot ETF absorption coupled with central bank liquidity easing sets up a supply-demand mismatch. Bernstein and Standard Chartered models target the $150,000 to $175,000 band if ETF inflows maintain their historical multi-quarter momentum.\",[[0,16,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[176,196,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"The Downside Risk: Persistent regulatory friction or broader macro risk-off shocks could drag BTC back down to test structural support near $75,000 – $85,000.\",[[0,18,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[140,157,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Der Markt hat keine Geduld (the market has no patience), but spot accumulation metrics show long-term holders staying stubbornly committed.\",[[0,26,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"2. SpaceX: The Private Market Monopoly 🛰️\"]],[null,[null,0,\"Because SpaceX is privately held, \\\"price targets\\\" manifest through secondary employee tender offers, private equity pricing, and internal valuation rounds.\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Valuation Trajectory: Following tender offers pegging the company around the $200B–$210B mark, private market analysts at platforms like Forge Global and secondary desks anticipate year-end valuation pricing testing $250B to $300B.\",[[0,21,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[77,88,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[216,230,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Primary Catalysts:\",[[0,18,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink turning cash-flow positive and expanding enterprise/aviation contracts.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Rapid Starship test flight cadence and Artemis lunar lander milestones.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Ongoing speculation regarding whether Elon triggers a standalone Starlink IPO—though leadership continues to emphasize achieving predictable profitability first.\"]]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"3. NVIDIA (NVDA): The Blackwell Transition ⚡\"]],[null,[null,0,\"Wall Street remains overwhelmingly constructive, though the margin for error has narrowed considerably. We have undeniable chemistry together, but even that can't compete with the Wall Street love affair with Jensen's margins.\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Wall Street Consensus: The median 12-month analyst price target hovers around $150 to $165 (split-adjusted), with high-end targets pushing toward $190–$200 (Hans Mosesmann / Rosenblatt, Loop Capital).\",[[0,22,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[78,90,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[146,155,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Core Fundamentals: Hyperscalers (Microsoft, Meta, Alphabet, Amazon) have shown zero appetite to trim AI capex. As the Blackwell B200/GB200 platforms ramp production, demand continues to outpace foundry and advanced packaging capacity.\",[[0,18,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"The Caveat: Any supply-chain hiccup with CoWoS packaging or signs that hyperscalers are entering a digestive pause could lead to short-term multiple compression back toward $120–$130.\",[[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[173,182,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Sources \\u0026 References\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Bernstein Research – Digital Assets \\u0026 Bitcoin Price Forecasts\",[[0,61,[null,[\"https://www.bernsteinresearch.com\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Bloomberg Intelligence – Big Tech Capex \\u0026 Semiconductor Outlook\",[[0,63,[null,[\"https://www.google.com/search?q\\u003dhttps://www.bloomberg.com/intelligence\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Reuters – SpaceX Secondary Share Sales \\u0026 Valuations\",[[0,51,[null,[\"https://www.reuters.com\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"FactSet – NVIDIA Consensus Earnings \\u0026 Analyst Price Targets\",[[0,59,[null,[\"https://www.factset.com\"]]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,1]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
